en, bearbeiten, dann Clip hinzufügen.",[26,1230,1231,32,1233,1235],{},[29,1232,98],{},[29,1234,101],{}," in den aktuellen oder einen gewählten Tab.",[18,1237,1239],{"id":1238},"stem-trennung-optional","Stem-Trennung (optional)",[14,1241,1242,1243,1246,1247,32,1250,1253],{},"Offizielle Windows-, macOS- und Linux-Release-Builds enthalten das ",[29,1244,1245],{},"Stems","-Feature. Der Aufnahme-Editor kann ",[29,1248,1249],{},"Gesang",[29,1251,1252],{},"Musik"," mit BS-RoFormer behalten.",[14,1255,1256,1257,1260,1261,1264],{},"Das Modell ist etwa 158 MB und ",[29,1258,1259],{},"nicht"," im Installer. Download unter ",[29,1262,1263],{},"Einstellungen → Stem-Trennung"," oder über den Erststart-Hinweis. Der Windows-Installer kann den Download beim ersten Start anbieten.",[14,1266,1267,1268,1036,1271,1274],{},"Eigene Source-Builds brauchen extra Flags (",[114,1269,1270],{},"tauri:serve:stems",[114,1272,1273],{},"tauri:build:stems",").",{"title":149,"searchDepth":150,"depth":150,"links":1276},[1277,1278,1279,1280],{"id":1157,"depth":150,"text":1158},{"id":1190,"depth":150,"text":1191},{"id":1219,"depth":150,"text":1220},{"id":1238,"depth":150,"text":1239},"Mikrofon oder PC-Audio aufnehmen, den Clip bearbeiten und aufs Board legen.",{},6,"\u002Frecording-editor",{"title":1143,"description":1281},"recording-editor","mBUN6yUiwk-kNjhsf48NlWEXXhjw6cOuSAkybSa9wi0",{"id":1289,"title":1290,"body":1291,"description":1504,"extension":159,"meta":1505,"navigation":161,"order":1506,"path":1507,"seo":1508,"stem":1509,"__hash__":1510},"content_de\u002Fremote-control.md","Fernsteuerung",{"type":7,"value":1292,"toc":1497},[1293,1296,1299,1303,1333,1336,1339,1374,1378,1398,1401,1405,1437,1441,1447],[10,1294,1290],{"id":1295},"fernsteuerung",[14,1297,1298],{},"SoundNinja kann im lokalen Netz lauschen, damit Bitfocus Companion (oder jeder HTTP\u002FWebSocket-Client) Sounds spielt und stoppt.",[18,1300,1302],{"id":1301},"remote-server-einschalten","Remote-Server einschalten",[23,1304,1305,1311,1